    <tr><td>Vera, 2026 [C41]</td><td>Mandatory contracts checked by an SMT solver: "The model doesn't need to be right, it needs to be checkable"</td><td>Gate at the function; no replay or promotion</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Decision models, a class of concept [C42]</td><td>A model whose entire output is a typed, calibrated choice among bounded options</td><td>Needs a closed option set. The RCE project builds its own decision head and uses no outside decision model</td></tr>
